{"type":"standard","title":"David Crowley (Wisconsin politician)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">David Crowley (Wisconsin politician)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q28151883","titles":{"canonical":"David_Crowley_(Wisconsin_politician)","normalized":"David Crowley (Wisconsin politician)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">David Crowley (Wisconsin politician)</span></span>"},"pageid":52800421,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Milwaukee_County_Executive_David_Crowley_during_Democratic_Primary_debate_on_July_28%2C_2026.jpg/330px-Milwaukee_County_Executive_David_Crowley_during_Democratic_Primary_debate_on_July_28%2C_2026.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":318},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/Milwaukee_County_Executive_David_Crowley_during_Democratic_Primary_debate_on_July_28%2C_2026.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1561,"height":1505},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1378814522","tid":"2ad34426-c157-11f1-8396-7beb9ba1b492","timestamp":"2026-10-06T07:25:55Z","description":"American politician (born 1986)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Crowley_(Wisconsin_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Crowley_(Wisconsin_politician)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Crowley_(Wisconsin_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:David_Crowley_(Wisconsin_politician)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Crowley_(Wisconsin_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/David_Crowley_(Wisconsin_politician)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Crowley_(Wisconsin_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:David_Crowley_(Wisconsin_politician)"}},"extract":"David Carl Crowley is an American politician who has served as the seventh executive of Milwaukee County since 2020. A member of the Democratic Party, he previously represented Wisconsin's 17th Assembly district, including the west side of Milwaukee, from 2017 to 2020. Crowley is the first African American to serve as Milwaukee County's top official and the youngest person elected to the office, having taken office in May 2020 at age 33.","extract_html":"<p><b>David Carl Crowley</b> is an American politician who has served as the seventh executive of Milwaukee County since 2020. A member of the Democratic Party, he previously represented Wisconsin's 17th Assembly district, including the west side of Milwaukee, from 2017 to 2020. Crowley is the first African American to serve as Milwaukee County's top official and the youngest person elected to the office, having taken office in May 2020 at age 33.</p>"}